all these things become one, and you will find yourself transcended to the future.", "short_description": "Neoverse is a beautiful, fantastic game consisting of adventures with thrilling challenges. It is a strategic, action, rogue-lite, deck building game that will test the player’s skill. Start an adventure with unique heroes to save the world along various timelines.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese, German, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Portugal, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America", "reviews": "“虽然也是RogueLite卡牌的玩法，但核心机制与同类作品明显不同。游戏中不同类型的卡牌以颜色区分，战斗时如果按顺序打出当前提示的颜色组合会激活连击效果，从而能够打出双倍伤害，但同时也要根据敌人下一回合的行动来取舍是打连击还是保命。游戏中用主动加点的天赋取代了装备，并且战斗是三选一的形式，玩家可根据手牌来选择战斗回报，这些设定都使得游戏时的主动性更强而不是被动接受。”<br>8.0 – 向日葵游戏<br><br>“A familiar mechanic of deck-building roguelite action, but where NEOVERSE really excels far and beyond its card battling competition is its sleek 3D presentation and interesting sci-fi environments.”<br>ReviewExperts<br><br>“制作相当精美的回合制卡牌游戏，有三位可爱的小姐姐可以选择，结合天赋系统使游戏玩法多种多样，小姐姐的换装play也增添了更多乐趣，打折期间价格也很友好，在同类型作品中值得推荐。”<br>黄油作品赏析0.0<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994220/header.jpg?t=1647465120", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994220/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1647465120", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994220/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1647465120", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/8.1 (32 or 64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ E8400 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 260 GTS or Radeon HD 4850 - 512 MB of VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><str